{start_of_verse: Strofa 1}
| [G]A-ma-zing | grace, how | [C]sweet the | [G]sound, that |
| [G]saved a | wretch like | [D]me! I | [D7] |
| [G]once was | [G7]lost, but | [C]now am | [G]found, was |
| [G]blind, but | [D]now I | [G]see. | |
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Strofa 2}

| [G]'Twas grace that | taught my | [C]heart to | [G]fear, and |
